('10630',NULL,'Nutanix Prism Element by HTTP','3','-1','2','','','Nutanix Prism Element by HTTP','0',NULL,'Prism Element: It is a service already built into the platform for every Nutanix cluster deployed. It provides the ability to fully configure, manage, and monitor Nutanix clusters running any hypervisors, however, it only manages the cluster it is part of.

