Array Controller Model. The type of controller card.','0','30d','0','',NULL,'3s','','','','200','1','0','','','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','db28dbd324304d07b20de5055d158c82','{#CNTLR_LOCATION}: DISK ARRAY CONTROLLER MODEL'),
