and at other times as indicated by the value of ifCounterDiscontinuityTime.','0','30d','0','',NULL,'3s','','','','200','1','0','','','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','2130b9e384b14fd7909d421c7756284a','INTERFACE {#IFNAME}({#IFALIAS}): INBOUND PACKETS DISCARDED'),
