and at other times as indicated by the value of ifCounterDiscontinuityTime.','0','30d','0','',NULL,'3s','','','','200','1','0','','','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','e5972a8dce67488cb6119c4f49d59a12','INTERFACE {#IFNAME}({#IFALIAS}): INBOUND PACKETS DISCARDED'),
