and at other times as indicated by the value of ifCounterDiscontinuityTime.','0','30d','0','',NULL,'3s','','','','200','1','0','','','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','f499f2a08c364fe6b7ba7c2edbeaa25a','INTERFACE {#IFNAME}({#IFALIAS}): INBOUND PACKETS DISCARDED'),
