and at other times as indicated by the value of ifCounterDiscontinuityTime.','0','30d','0','',NULL,'3s','','','','200','1','0','','','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','7f6edc44bbc94228befed84190c70fdb','INTERFACE {#IFNAME}({#IFALIAS}): INBOUND PACKETS DISCARDED'),
