and at other times as indicated by the value of ifCounterDiscontinuityTime.','0','30d','0','',NULL,'3s','','','','200','1','0','','','0','0','0','0','0','0','0','fe34a8167761431598cb66871b8ccc0d','INTERFACE {#IFNAME}({#IFALIAS}): INBOUND PACKETS DISCARDED'),
