('43467','18','','10526','Task [{#NAME}]: Type','hpe.primera.task["{#ID}",type]','0','7d','365d','0','3','','','','',NULL,'1003','','','0','','','','','2',NULL,'Task type:

VV_COPY (1) - track the physical copy operations;
