('17285','{20403}>{$CPU.INTERRUPT.CRIT.MAX}','Windows: CPU interrupt time is too high','','0','2',E'"The CPU Interrupt Time in the last 5 minutes exceeds {$CPU.INTERRUPT.CRIT.MAX}%."
